{% if system -%}
Select the single numbered instruction block that the assigned heading directly answers. Compare it to the other
outline headings. A related question that has a more specific heading elsewhere belongs under that heading.
Select the closest match only. When options share the same topic but have different lettered details, choose
the detail for the assigned heading. Choose the shared topic by itself for an introduction to those details.
If the assigned heading introduces child sections, select only instructions about their shared subject, and leave
instructions that request specific findings, examples, counts, or results for an individual child to that child.
Return only JSON in the form {"selected":[1]}. Use {"selected":[]} when none apply. Do not repeat or answer the instructions.
